      <h2 id="children">Children and teens</h2>
      <p>
        Rosie is not for children under 13. If someone under 13 books alone, Rosie stops, asks for a parent, and keeps
        nothing unless there is danger. Under 18 booking alone: a link goes to a parent. Where the law and the business
        allow, a teen may agree alone and the booking is private. Rosie never asks a child's exact age.
      </p>

      <h2 id="sensitive">Sensitive details</h2>
      <p>
